ext":"Undisciplined, inelegant, unoriginal, uninspired... and completely uncoordinated.","nextNodeIds":[727340102]},{"nodeId":727340102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":373177194,"text":"Hey, what'cha complaining about? Oh, lemme guess, all your teammates we defeated?","nextNodeIds":[727340103]},{"nodeId":727340103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13089,"speakerName":"Wizard Moneybags","textMapHash":3883039458,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[727340104]},{"nodeId":727340104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13089,"speakerName":"Wizard Moneybags","textMapHash":1818872426,"text":"I'm talking about your fighting style.","nextNodeIds":[727340105]},{"nodeId":727340105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":4260656522,"text":"Huh? Have you been hit in the head by a Specter, or something? This ain't some circus show, pal! You wanna know what my style is? Uncheckable strength, unwreckable will, and undefeatable beetles, that's what! I can give you a demonstration — if you dare.","nextNodeIds":[727340106]},{"nodeId":727340106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13089,"speakerName":"Wizard Moneybags","textMapHash":2688677794,"text":"Ugh, you bring back some bad memories... I do not deal well with loud and obnoxious types like you.","nextNodeIds":[727340107]},{"nodeId":727340107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13089,"speakerName":"Wizard Moneybags","textMapHash":2649267858,"text":"#Ah, but this {M#blond fellow}{F#blonde lady} looks like easy pickings... Alright, I'll challenge {M#him}{F#her}!","nextNodeIds":[727340108]},{"nodeId":727340108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":2527334250,"text":"Pfft! Hahahahahahaha!","nextNodeIds":[727340109]},{"nodeId":727340109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":723993250,"text":"Hahahaha! Hey, compadre, did you hear what this joker just said? He thinks you're an easy win! So uh, how about you show him a little Arataki Gang hospitality?","nextNodeIds":[727340110,727340111]},{"nodeId":727340110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2028398242,"text":"Haha, gladly!","nextNodeIds":[727340112]},{"nodeId":727340112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1484757938,"text":"Paimon doesn't get it... These people haven't researched their opponents at all! All they're doing by coming one at a time is contributing to our winning streak.","nextNodeIds":[727340113]},{"nodeId":727340113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2568046354,"text":"Grandmaster Hanakado's team members are a real mixed bag! They're no match for us three when it comes to strategy!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":727340111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4267176274,"text":"Oh nooo~! Please don't bully me...","nextNodeIds":[727340112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7273401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133209113"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["13089"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7273401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13089,"speakerName":"Wizard Moneybags","count":5},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName"